career=hero("Academy / LDTT Certification","Become a LDTT Certified Dog Trainer and Independent Business Owner","Lorenzo's Dog Training Team gives committed individuals a real pathway into the dog training industry as independent business owners.",buttons=False)+f'''<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">More than a certificate</span><h2>Build a real dog training business.</h2><p>Lorenzo's Dog Training Team gives committed individuals a real pathway into the dog training industry as independent business owners. This is not about applying for a job or simply earning a certification. It is about learning a proven dog training system, developing your own client base, and building a successful dog training business with structure, mentorship, and support behind you.</p><p>Through Lorenzo's proven training system, aspiring trainers learn how to work with dogs, communicate with owners, understand behavior modification, and deliver professional results that families can trust. The goal is not only to teach you how to train dogs. The goal is to help you understand how to operate, grow, and sustain a real dog training business.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-red" href="trainer-application.html">Apply To Become A Trainer</a><a class="btn btn-navy" href="#ownership">Explore the Trainer Business Path</a></div></div><figure class="video-card"><video controls preload="metadata" playsinline src="assets/ldtt-trainer-testimonials.mp4" poster="assets/ldtt-trainer-testimonials-poster.jpg"></video></figure></div></section><section class="section soft" id="ownership"><div class="container">{title("Become a professional dog trainer with ownership behind it.","As you grow through the program, you are guided through the process of building your own client base, serving families in your area, and developing your own territory.")}<div class="program-detail">{detail("Learn How Ownership Works","Represent the system professionally, create trust with clients, manage expectations, and build long-term relationships that support business growth.")}{detail("Build Your Client Base","Develop your own client base while learning how to serve families in your area with structure, accountability, and professional standards.")}{detail("Train With Lorenzo's Team","Learn the technique behind the training, client communication, behavior modification, and the process for delivering trusted results.")}{detail("Schedule a Discovery Call","Use the contact form and choose Learn more about becoming a dog trainer so the office can route your request correctly.")}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">In business for yourself, but not by yourself.</span><h2>A proven path with mentorship and support.</h2><p>You are not left alone to figure everything out. Lorenzo's Dog Training Team provides the training, systems, mentorship, and professional standards needed to help you move with confidence. From learning the technique behind the training, to understanding how to communicate with clients, to developing your own business structure, this pathway is designed to support serious individuals who are ready to build.</p><p>This is for people who want more than a certificate. It is for those who want a skill, a business model, a client base, and the opportunity to grow as independent dog training business owners under a proven training system.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Independence, ownership, and a proven path to follow.</li><li>Training, systems, mentorship, and professional standards.</li><li>Client-development guidance and territory growth.</li><li>Dog handling, owner communication, and behavior modification.</li></ul><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-red" href="trainer-application.html">Apply To Become A Trainer</a><a class="btn btn-navy" href="contact.html#form">Schedule a Discovery Call</a></div></div><figure class="photo-card"><img src="assets/trainer-ownership-photo.png" alt="Lorenzo trainer ownership pathway image"></figure></div></section><section class="section navy"><div class="container split"><div><h2 style="color:white">Start your path from professional dog trainer to independent business owner.</h2><p style="color:#d8e3f1">Build with the training, mentorship, client-development guidance, and proven system of Lorenzo's Dog Training Team.</p></div><figure class="video-card"><video controls preload="metadata" playsinline src="assets/ldtt-recruitment-video.mp4" poster="assets/ldtt-recruitment-video-poster.jpg"></video></figure></div></section>'''

